msgid "He even gave me a few leads to get me on the right track. So... yeah, I think I'll be just fine."
msgstr "Incluso me dio unas cuantas pistas para seguir el camino correcto.\nAsí que... supongo que estaré bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
